Z||000000||ChadMan||07-21-2001||07:45 PM||||Today I replaced the original muffler on my 88 Coupe with a Maremont Turbo II muffler from AutoZone.  The muffler, patch pipe and clamps totaled less than $40 - and I got to keep the nearly-indestructible factory stainless exhaust pipe.  I had to copy off of 2M4Dale and splurge for some tasteful 2" rolled exhaust tips, too.<P>It's nice and quiet at idle and when cruising, but when you stomp it, it sounds like an old British sports car.  No more fumes with the sunroof open!<P>And to think Tuffy wanted more than $200 to replace the muffler.  Nothing like a Fiero job gone right to make your day!||||reg||10
